# GLOBEX ENGINEERING — PROJECT PROMETHEUS ARCHITECTURE (2026)
## 1. System Architecture
- Codename: Project Prometheus
- Technology Stack: Distributed Rust microservices with gRPC communication.
- Core Ingestion: Apache Kafka event streaming cluster with high-throughput partitioning.

## 2. Database & Cache Layer
- Primary Database: Apache Cassandra cluster for distributed wide-column storage.
- Caching: Redis Cluster with sub-millisecond in-memory lookups.
- Vector Engine: PostgreSQL pgvector for high-dimensional semantic search.

## 3. Infrastructure & Deployment
- Deployment: Kubernetes bare-metal cluster with Cilium eBPF network mesh.
- Security Level: TOP SECRET GLOBEX INTERNAL ONLY.
